        "quote": "(a) Whenever it is determined that a person has made an overpayment of a wastewater service charge, the City shall, at the City’s option, make restitution or provide a credit to the customer; provided, that the City’s liability for restitution or credit shall not extend more than two years immediately preceding the discovery of the overpayment.",
