          "end": 993,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.810:block:1",
          "start": 347
        },
        "quote": "(b) Whenever it is determined that a person is receiving or has received wastewater services from the City without the City’s knowledge or without assessment by the City, or has been assessed less than the authorized amount, the City shall assess the customer a wastewater service charge in accordance with the authorized schedule of rates; provided, that the City shall be entitled to collect the charges for services received within the two years immediately preceding the discovery of the sewer connection, the lack of billing, or the improper billing. (Ord. 19496 § 102, 12-21-10. Code 1981 § 44-307. Code 1995 § 146-353. Formerly 14.80.890.)",
